# What `ts deploy` never ships and never deletes on the box (an rsync filter
# file: first match wins).
#
# Worktrees live inside the repository; none of them is the tree being shipped.
- /.claude/
# The box's .env holds production secrets and is never sent or overwritten. A
# wildcard, so an editor's .env~ is never sent either.
- .env*
- venv
- __pycache__
- .mypy_cache
- .pytest_cache
- *.egg-info
- /dist/
- /build/
